name=Comfy Grid - Tile Inventory
id=ComfyGrid
author=Darkeng
description=Replaces Project Zomboid's list inventory with a grid of square tiles (Build 42), with the game's icons redrawn at twice the resolution. Identical items auto-stack with a counter, and a left-click on a stack shows each item. Every container within reach stacks as a section with its own buttons, and any bag opens in its own window. The equipment gets a docked window with a live 3D character. Five colour themes, settings panel in game, full controller support, full multiplayer support.
